@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@transportOrderId = 1
@deliveryId = 1

### Preview unsaved delivery ordering without replacing saved legs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transportorder/{{transportOrderId}}/route-preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveries": [
    { "id": {{deliveryId}}, "sortOrder": 1 }
  ]
}

### Recalculate and persist the saved transport order's legs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transportorder/{{transportOrderId}}/route/recalculate

### Invalid transport order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transportorder/999999999/route/recalculate
